{"title": "Floyd's cycle detection, then the cycle start", "view": "list", "steps": [{"nodes": [3, 2, 0, -4, 7, 9], "links": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 2], "pointers": {"slow": 0, "fast": 0}, "highlight": [], "vars": {}, "caption": "The last node points back to index 2: a cycle. Phase 1: slow moves 1, fast moves 2. In a cycle, fast catches up by 1 each step."}, {"nodes": [3, 2, 0, -4, 7, 9], "links": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 2], "pointers": {"slow": 1, "fast": 2}, "highlight": [], "vars": {}, "caption": "slow at 2, fast at 0."}, {"nodes": [3, 2, 0, -4, 7, 9], "links": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 2], "pointers": {"slow": 2, "fast": 4}, "highlight": [], "vars": {}, "caption": "slow at 0, fast at 7."}, {"nodes": [3, 2, 0, -4, 7, 9], "links": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 2], "pointers": {"slow": 3, "fast": 2}, "highlight": [], "vars": {}, "caption": "slow at -4, fast at 0."}, {"nodes": [3, 2, 0, -4, 7, 9], "links": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 2], "pointers": {"slow": 4, "fast": 4}, "highlight": [4], "vars": {}, "caption": "slow at 7, fast at 7. They meet: there is a cycle."}, {"nodes": [3, 2, 0, -4, 7, 9], "links": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 2], "pointers": {"a": 0, "b": 4}, "highlight": [], "vars": {}, "caption": "Phase 2: put one pointer back at the head, leave the other at the meeting point. Move both 1 step at a time."}, {"nodes": [3, 2, 0, -4, 7, 9], "links": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 2], "pointers": {"a": 1, "b": 5}, "highlight": [], "vars": {}, "caption": "a at 2, b at 9."}, {"nodes": [3, 2, 0, -4, 7, 9], "links": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 2], "pointers": {"a": 2, "b": 2}, "highlight": [2], "vars": {}, "caption": "a at 0, b at 0. They meet at 0 (index 2): the start of the cycle."}, {"nodes": [3, 2, 0, -4, 7, 9], "links": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 2], "pointers": {"start": 2}, "highlight": [2], "vars": {}, "caption": "Why: the distance from the head to the cycle start equals the distance from the meeting point to the start (going around). O(n) time, O(1) space."}]}
